      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so im feeling kinda weird lately. im drinking like crazy amounts of water cuz im always thirsty, and i keep running to the bathroom every hour. also my breath smells kinda sweet? almost like fruit or something? i think im just super dehydrated from the heat, maybe i just need more electrolytes? what do u think",
