    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ik i should probably go but im so broke and a doctor visit is gonna cost like a whole paycheck right now. is there any way i can just test it myself at home or maybe just take some vitamins to see if it goes away? like maybe some extra magnesium or something might help if its just a metabolic thing?",
