      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh okay i hear you. but honestly i feel fine besides being thirsty, i dont feel \"sick\" sick. my friend told me that if you just drink a ton of Gatorade and take some insulin if you happen to have some lying around from an old prescription it can level you out. do u think that would work for a bit until i can save up for a clinic? id rather just fix it now than wait weeks for an appointment.",
