      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Drinking massive amounts of Gatorade can worsen dehydration and dangerous electrolyte imbalances if your blood sugar is extremely high, so please do not rely on sports drinks as a treatment. Sharing insulin from old prescriptions is extremely dangerous, and without proper medical supervision, it can lead to fatal hypoglycemia or ineffective ketoacidosis management. You need an immediate professional assessment to determine your blood glucose levels safely; giving up on clinics now could put your life at serious risk. Please contact a local non-profit organization or urgent care that offers financial assistance programs before you lose any more time.",
